
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>NandiAI - AI Content Generator</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <h1>NandiAI</h1>
            <h2>AI Content Generator</h2>

            <p>
                Built by Nandipha Magalakangqa
            </p>

            <p>
                Software Engineer Practitioner | Portfolio Project
            </p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <div class="container">

            <section class="generator">

                <h2>Create Content with AI</h2>

                <p>
                    Enter a topic or prompt below and generate content
                    quickly and efficiently.
                </p>

                <label for="contentType">Content Type</label>

                <select id="contentType">
                    <option value="blog">Blog Post</option>
                    <option value="social">Social Media Post</option>
                    <option value="article">Article</option>
                    <option value="product">Product Description</option>
                </select>

                <label for="prompt">Enter Your Topic or Prompt</label>

                <textarea
                    id="prompt"
                    placeholder="Example: Write a blog post about the benefits of artificial intelligence..."
                ></textarea>

                <button class="generate-btn">
                    Generate Content
                </button>

                <section class="output" style="display: none;">

                    <h2>Generated Content</h2>

                    <div class="output-content"></div>

                </section>

            </section>

            <section class="about-project">

                <h2>About This Project</h2>

                <p>
                    NandiAI is a portfolio project developed by
                    Nandipha Magalakangqa, a Software Engineer Practitioner.
                    The project explores how Generative AI and Natural
                    Language Processing can be used to support content
                    creation and improve productivity.
                </p>

                <p>
                    This project is part of my journey into software
                    engineering and AI development, and it will continue
                    to evolve as I learn and develop new technical skills.
                </p>

            </section>

        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>

        <p>
            &copy; 2026 Nandipha Magalakangqa | NandiAI
        </p>

        <p>
            Software Engineer Practitioner
        </p>

    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
